// Test-cell deployment: the person-cell routes, the household cell, the secrets cell,
// ConformanceCell, the durability lab, and the guard bench. Never deployed to a person cell. The
// empty vars are names only: secbot-release fills them on the VPS at deploy time.
// SECBOT_MARK_THRESHOLD_CAPS is a test-cell setting, not a secret: it lowers the reminder tool's
// mark threshold to 0, so every reminder the decision model answers reaches the reviewer (a cap
// can only lower a threshold). The production config (wrangler.jsonc) never carries it.
{
  "name": "secbot",
  "main": "index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "compatibility_flags": ["js_rpc"],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [
      { "name": "CONFORMANCE", "class_name": "ConformanceCell" },
      { "name": "PERSON_CELL", "class_name": "PersonCell" },
      { "name": "HOUSEHOLD_CELL", "class_name": "HouseholdCell" },
      { "name": "LAB", "class_name": "DurabilityLabCell" },
      { "name": "SECRETS_CELL", "class_name": "SecretsCell" },
      { "name": "GUARD_BENCH", "class_name": "GuardBenchCell" }
    ]
  },
  "migrations": [
    { "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["ConformanceCell"] },
    { "tag": "v2", "new_sqlite_classes": ["PersonCell"] },
    { "tag": "v3", "new_sqlite_classes": ["HouseholdCell", "DurabilityLabCell"] },
    { "tag": "v4", "new_sqlite_classes": ["SecretsCell"] },
    { "tag": "v5", "new_sqlite_classes": ["GuardBenchCell"] }
  ],
  "r2_buckets": [{ "binding": "SNAPSHOTS", "bucket_name": "secbot-snapshots" }],
  "vars": {
    "OPENROUTER_API_KEY": "",
    "BETTERSTACK_INCIDENTS_TOKEN": "",
    "BETTERSTACK_REQUESTER_EMAIL": "",
    "SECBOT_DEVICE_KEYS": "",
    "SECBOT_PRIVATE_HOSTS": "",
    "SECBOT_HEARTBEAT_URLS": "",
    "SECBOT_TIME_ZONE": "",
    "SECBOT_OPERATOR_KEY": "",
    "SECBOT_FLEET_CELLS": "",
    "SECBOT_HOUSEHOLD_URL": "",
    "SECBOT_SECRETS_URL": "",
    "SECBOT_KEY_HELPER_URL": "",
    "SECBOT_MARK_THRESHOLD_CAPS": "{\"set_reminder\":0}"
  }
}
